 - 2026-06-01: Build a REAL factual-hallucination corpus from an external benchmark (RAGTruth arXiv:2401.00396, with FELM / HaluEval fallback) — evidence passages + binary hallucination labels + model-confidence — to stress-test whether the .335 'facts domain-bound' negative is a synthetic-corpus artifact (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: real_factual_corpus_built_ragtruth_non_degenerate; results/experiment_3669_build_real_factual_corpus.json
