 - 2026-06-01: SHIP the second-pair-of-eyes detector into the Phase-1 product surface — a clean calibrated fused-detector API in python/carnot/pipeline/ wired to score_candidates (MCP/CLI), with math-validated + balanced-code operating points (exp3658 corpus) and an E2E test (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: second_pair_of_eyes_detector_shipped_math_only_code_weak_documented_e2e_green; results/experiment_3671_ship_second_pair_of_eyes_detector.json
+- 2026-06-01: NEW direction — verifier-ensemble SELECTION value where self-consistency is WEAK: build/identify a corpus where majority-vote SC is near-chance (high answer entropy / ambiguous problems) and test whether the ensemble adds real best-of-N selection value confidence/SC cannot (flips the answered P0.1 near-optimal-SC premise) (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=complete: ensemble_no_selection_value_even_with_headroom_sc_weak_earned_negative; results/experiment_3672_ensemble_selection_where_sc_weak.json
